@startuml
title Set exchange rates (administrator)
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow false
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
actor "Bank administrator" as admin
participant "Admin Web App\n(React SPA)" as spa
participant "Core Banking API\n(FastAPI)" as api
database "PostgreSQL" as db

admin -> spa : Opens Exchange rates and enters: base currency, target currency, rate
spa -> spa : Validates the form (rate > 0, base != target)
spa -> api : POST /admin/exchange-rates\n {baseCurrency, targetCurrency, rate}
api -> api : Authenticates the user (token) and checks the ADMIN role
api -> db : SELECT code FROM currencies\n WHERE code IN (:base, :target)
db --> api : existing currency codes

alt unknown currency or invalid rate
api --> spa : 422 unprocesable Entity
spa --> admin : Shows error message
else data is valid 
api -> db : INSERT INTO exchange_rates (base_currency, target_currency, rate)
db --> api : id, rate_timestamp (default now())
api --> spa : 201 Created {id, rate, rateTimestamp}
spa --> admin : Shows confirmation
end

Note over api,db : Rates are never updated, each change is a new row,\nthe current of a pair is its newest row.\nOld rows keep the history.
@enduml
